WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
Mr. Li, does Guisi have a clear plan to go public?

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:04,040
I hope that the new funding structure will include Qi Quan

3
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:06,960
Without a listing plan, Qi Quan cannot give it to the next person.

4
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,400
I come from a top foreign family background

5
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,040
As long as Guis gives me enough decision-making power

6
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,720
Foreign investors are not allowed. Next one.

7
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,640
Mr. Li, I don’t want to lose my salary.

8
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:15,600
My rule is

9
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,560
For every deal I negotiate, I’ll get 15% for the next person.

10
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:20,440
Mr. Li is the last one left.

11
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:22,160
Ruan Nuo Secretary of the Board of Directors

12
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:24,120
Follow the boss from zero to listed

13
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:26,840
I don’t have to choose my ability, I just have a condition

14
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:27,840
what conditions

15
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:30,510
