17
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:34,350
The reason why he left his previous company

18
00:00:34,350 --> 00:00:36,670
It was the chairman who drank and became evil.

19
00:00:36,670 --> 00:00:38,150
I didn’t expect this girl to have a strong temper

20
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:39,630
I made the boss unable to step down on the spot

21
00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:41,910
Although the matter was suppressed, the result

22
00:00:41,910 --> 00:00:43,590
If you get bitten by a snake, you will be afraid of the police god for ten years.

23
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:49,200
I understand. Let her in.

24
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:51,650
The boss is so young

25
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:54,500
You're so weak, aren't you? Please sit down.

26
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:56,100
This boss is not an ordinary person.
